    <div class="service-proof"><a class="service-proof__image-link" href="/cases/carrabbas/" aria-label="View case study: Carrabba’s Italian Grill content platform"><img src="/images/carrabbas-case_thumb.webp" alt="Carrabba’s Italian Grill content platform" width="760" height="520" loading="lazy" /></a><h3>Content & navigation</h3><p>The Carrabba’s case study looks at content architecture and the experience of finding and exploring culinary content.</p><a href="/cases/carrabbas/">Read the Carrabba’s case study ↗</a></div>
